[{"code":"record_may_be_shared","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":19,"col":25},"end":{"line":19,"col":44}},"title":"RECORD MAY BE SHARED","message":"`{ p | x = p.x + 1 }` changes `p` itself, and the function that does it goes\nwhere the checker cannot see every call of it: it is stored in a record.\n\n19|mover ⊤ = { step = λp → { p | x = p.x + 1 } }\n                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the record is changed in place here\n\nTo be safe, change a copy:\n\n19|mover ⊤ = { step = λp → { Record.copy p | x = p.x + 1 } }\n\nThis is a limit of the checker, not proof of sharing: a call it cannot see may\nhand the function a record something else still holds."}]
